{
  "schema": "HC6",
  "name": "nonApi_claimVersionEmails",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "The API's VersionEmail sender claims the next @take queued rows of a send: Status 0 -> 3 (sending) in one UPDATE with READPAST, so two senders split the rows and never mail one person twice. Internal (API only). Idempotency: compare-and-set.",
